## A matte wall lit by a square polygon emitter above and in front of it, out of frame, wound to emit
## toward the wall, with a black sphere between them casting a soft shadow. The square has the disk
## fixture's area. The emitter and the blocker are black and the wall is one plane, so the path tracer
## renders direct light alone. Not third-party.
Display "rayarealight_panel.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 48 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [64]
Option "raytracer" "integer arealightsamples" [64]
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
AttributeBegin
AreaLightSource "arealight" 1 "intensity" [60]
Color [0 0 0]
Surface "matte"
Translate 0 2.5 -4
Polygon "P" [-0.443 -0.443 0  0.443 -0.443 0  0.443 0.443 0  -0.443 0.443 0]
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
Color [0 0 0]
Surface "matte"
Translate 0 1.4 -2
Sphere 0.3 -0.3 0.3 360
AttributeEnd
Surface "matte" "Kd" [0.8]
Polygon "P" [-4 -4 0  -4 4 0  4 4 0  4 -4 0]
WorldEnd
